## Quick Reference
Services MUST extend `BaseService<T>` with:
- options: { entityName, cache, defaultSearchField, relationsWhitelist, selectWhitelist }
- Override `getSearchableColumns()` for searchable fields
- Use lifecycle hooks for side effects
